The transform implementation ports the formula evaluation transform from
Pentaho Data Integration (Kettle) to the Apache Hop transform and metadata APIs.

Calculation engine:
This product includes `hop-formula`, a clean-room OpenFormula (ODF 1.2 / OpenDocument-v1.2-part2)
calculation engine developed under the Apache License, Version 2.0, with zero runtime
dependencies. No code was copied or derived from the defunct LGPL/BSL Pentaho libformula library.

"Pentaho" is a trademark of its respective owners and is used here only to
describe compatibility with existing PDI Formula pipeline metadata and expressions.
